 "verdict_rule": "per cell (graph, rows, blanket; 20 datasets, one target each): D = Andrey's minus the authors' code's SHD of the local graph and Euclidean weight distance per dataset, on the datasets both finished; worse when the 95% percentile-bootstrap interval of the mean D lies wholly above 0 (10,000 resamples of the datasets, default_rng(0)), better when wholly below, a tie otherwise. A cell worse on seeds 0-19 was rerun on seeds 20-39 and is worse only when the fresh seeds agree",
